{
  "id": "EZK.37",
  "number": "37",
  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Ezekieli 37",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "37",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "37",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rikura riarenge namauga amomo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoboko kw’Omonene kogaacha igoro y’ane, na Omoika bw’Omonene akang’ira akambeka ase egati ye rikura riaichire amauga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akang’etia ase egati y’amauga aria, nkarora ng’a nigo arenge amaange mono ase rikura riria, naende nkarora ng’a nigo arenge amomo pa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akamboria, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, amauga aya nanyare koba moyo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkairaneria, nkamoteebia: “Aye Omonene, naye omanyete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende aganteebia, “Banera amauga aya, oyateebie: Inwe amauga amomo, igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro Omonene akobateebia inwe amauga: Rora, nimbeke omoika bw’obomoyo ime yaino, na inwe imobe moyo naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbabeekere emekia, mbabeekere ne chinyama, nimbatube ne risankwa, naende mbautere omoika bw’obomoyo, na inwe mobe moyo naende. Erio nario moramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio nkabana buna Omonene anchigete: na ekero nagendererete kobana, nkaigwa eriogi rinene riarenge negetitiro; amauga ayio agacha amo, riuga rikabwatana neriuga riamwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero narigereretie, nkarora emekia egacha igoro y’amauga aria, ne chinyama chikaba ase emekia, ne risankwa rikabituba, korende omoika torenge ime yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omonene Nyasae agantebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, bana orangerie omoika, bana oyoteebie ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Aye omoika, inchwo korwa ase chimbeo inye chi’ense, erio outere aba iga baitetwe omoika bw’obomoyo, erinde babe moyo naende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkabana buna Omonene anchigete. Omoika bw’obomoyo ogasoa ime yabo, barabwo bakaba moyo, bagatenena namagoro abo; nigo barenge omoganda omonene mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Omonene aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, amauga aya naro egesaku gionsi ki’Abaisraeli. Rora, barabwo nigo bagoteeba: Amauga aito omire pa, na ogosemeria gwaito gwasirire; intwe bono twasirigwe kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, bana ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Inwe abanto bane, rora, ninyigore chimbeera chiaino, mbarusieo, erinde mbairanie gochia inka, ase ense y’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abanto bane, ekero ekio ndaigore chimbeera mbarusieo, erio nario moramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene nigo ngoteeba iga: Nimbeke omoika one ime yaino, na inwe mobe moyo. Nimbarente, mbabeeke ase ense yaino. Erio momanye ng’a ninche Omonene nakwanire ayio, boigo nayakorire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abayuda na Abaisraeli mbabe ab’oborwoti obomo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha asende, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, imokia enyimbo oyeriike: Ase Abayuda na ase Abaisraeli abwo babwatanire nabarabwo. Naende imokia enyimbo ende oyeriike: Ase enyomba ya Yusufu (nero eya Efraimu) na ase Abaisraeli bonsi babwatanire nenyomba eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinyimbo echio ochibwatanie amo chibe enyimbo eyemo ere ase okoboko kwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto bamino barakoborie iga: Inee! Nototeebie engencho gwakorera iga?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obateebie ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Rora, ninyimokie enyimbo y’enyomba ya Yusufu (eyio ere ase okoboko gwa Efraimu) amo nebisaku bi’Abaisraeli, ebio biabwatanire nero; erio inyebwateranie amo nenyimbo y’Abayuda, erinde chibe enyimbo eyemo ere ase okoboko kwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chinyimbo echio orabe kwariikire ochibwate ase okoboko kwao agwo ase amaiso y abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio obateebie ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Naama! Nindusie Abaisraeli korwa ase egati y’ abanto b’ebisaku agwo ase bairetwe, mbasangererie korwa ase chinsemo chionsi, mbarente ase ense yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbakore babe egesaku ekemo ase ense eyio, agwo ase ebitunwa bi’Abaisraeli. Omorwoti oyomo nabe okobagambera bonsi. Tibakogenderera koba ebisaku bibere, gose gwatananeka babe amarwoti abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibakogenderera gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka ase ogosasiima emegwekano yabo, gose ase ogokora kwabo gw’okogechia, gose ase ogosaria kwabo konde gwonsi. Nimbatoorie korwa ase obomenyo bwabo bwonsi agwo aase bakorerete ebibe, nimbachene. Erio mbabe abanto bane, na inche nimbe Nyasae obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi, omosomba one, nere orabe omorwoti obo, na barabwo mbabe nomorisia oyomo, mbabwatie emeroberio y’ane echiikire, naende babwate amachiiko ane na koyakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbamenye ase ense eyio chisokoro chiabo chiamenyete, eyio naete Yakobo, omosomba one. Barabwo mbamenyeo, boigo na abana babo, na abachokoro, na abachokororia, goika kare na kare; na Daudi, omosomba one, nere orabe omogambi obo goika kare na kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkore okobwatana kw’omorembe amo nabarabwo; okwo nigo korabe ogwa kare na kare. Nimbabeeke aroro, mbamentekanie. Nimbeke Obomenyo bwane Obochenu bobe ase egati yabo kogenderera botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obomenyo bwane mbobe amo nabarabwo, na inche nimbe Nyasae obo, na barabwo mbabe abanto bane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Obomenyo bwane Obochenu boragenderere kobeera amo n’Abaisraeli kogenderera botambe, erio abanto b’ebisaku ’mbamanye ng’a inche Omonene nigo ngochena Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
